      "extract": "arXiv:math/0505170v2 [math.RT] 12 Jan 2006 AN AVERAGING PROCESS FOR UNIPOTENT GROUP ACTIONS AMNON YEKUTIELI Abstract. We present an averaging process for sections of a torsor under a unipotent group. This process allows one to integrate local sections of such a torsor into a global simplicial section. The results of this paper have applica- tions to deformation quantization of algebraic varieties.",
